flowchart LR
  UI[Client] -->|HTTP + API key| GW[Gateway]
  GW -->|gRPC Call: Applicant / Credential / Rules / Record| MB[Python Message Broker]
  GW -->|HTTP: Player / Session / Moderation / DMS; SSE| HTTP[Remaining public service routes]
  MB <-->|gRPC Call / Publish / Deliver| DOMAIN[Eight domain services]
  DOMAIN -->|HTTP registration + subscriptions| SD[Service Discovery]
  MB -->|HTTP instance + topic lookup| SD
  MB -->|Durable topic copies + dead letters| STORE[(SQLite /data on broker-data)]
  DOMAIN --> DATA[(Owned databases + inbox / outbox)]
  PROM[Prometheus] -->|metrics per replica| DOMAIN
  PROM -->|metrics| MB
  GRAF[Grafana] --> PROM

  subgraph record-postgres HA
    RP1[record-postgres-1\nprimary] -->|WAL sync| RP2[record-postgres-2\nsync standby]
    RP1 -->|WAL| RP3[record-postgres-3\nstandby]
    RPGW[HAProxy\nrecord-postgres] --> RP1
  end
  DOMAIN -->|JDBC: record-postgres:5432| RPGW

  subgraph rules-mongo RS
    RM1[rules-mongo-1\nprimary] -->|replication| RM2[rules-mongo-2\nsecondary]
    RM1 -->|replication| RM3[rules-mongo-3\nsecondary]
  end
  DOMAIN -->|mongodb RS URI| RM1

  subgraph etcd
    E1[postgres-etcd-1] --- E2[postgres-etcd-2] --- E3[postgres-etcd-3]
  end
  RP1 & RP2 & RP3 <-->|leader lock| E1

  ETL[ETL job\ndiana7376/pad-etl] -->|read-only SQL / Mongo / Redis| DOMAIN
  ETL -->|INSERT ... ON CONFLICT| WH[(warehouse-db\nstar schema)]
